      },
      "body": "Commission on Persons with Disabilities"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-13",
      "text": "The commission is reviewing a proposed 22-home project with homes for adults with disabilities and affordable rentals.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sY6AwUuHzjI",
        "ts": "1:34:29",
        "endTs": "1:35:39",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-12T06:30:07.228Z"
      },
      "body": "Commission on Persons with Disabilities"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-13",
      "text": "Seven homes are licensed homes for adults with disabilities, with live-in caregivers.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sY6AwUuHzjI",
        "ts": "1:33:13",
        "endTs": "1:34:20",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-12T06:30:07.228Z"
      },
      "body": "Commission on Persons with Disabilities"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-13",
      "text": "The chair asked whether the project has reached agencies with waiting lists of families needing accessible homes.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sY6AwUuHzjI",
        "ts": "1:29:48",
        "endTs": "1:30:50",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-12T06:30:07.228Z"
      },
      "body": "Commission on Persons with Disabilities"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-13",
      "text": "The chair said the land lease calls for the homes to be mainly for people with disabilities.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sY6AwUuHzjI",
        "ts": "1:29:30",
        "endTs": "1:30:01",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-12T06:30:07.228Z"
      },
      "body": "Commission on Persons with Disabilities"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-09",
      "text": "The commission tabled, or put off, a proposed housing development item until the next meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "4m34BcHhzUs",
        "ts": "1:07:46",
        "endTs": "1:08:25",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:17.645Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-09",
      "text": "A commissioner said the site makes it hard for people with mobility issues to walk to town.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "4m34BcHhzUs",
        "ts": "1:07:22",
        "endTs": "1:07:52",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:17.645Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-09",
      "text": "A commissioner said people living in the project's licensed homes and day program should have equal access to the wider community.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "4m34BcHhzUs",
        "ts": "1:07:00",
        "endTs": "1:07:37",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:17.645Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-09",
      "text": "A commissioner said there was not enough information to act on the item at this meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "4m34BcHhzUs",
        "ts": "1:06:25",
        "endTs": "1:06:55",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:17.645Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-09",
      "text": "A representative of the project offered to consult with the commission and give updates.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "4m34BcHhzUs",
